\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Yen recovery, c.bank talk help pare falls. \b0\par\par\uc2 913 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juni 2001\par 11:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, June 22 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  trimmed \par \par \uc2  some early losses late on Friday, helped by the yen's \par \par \uc2  bounce off a two-month low and talk that some central banks \par \par \uc2  were in the market to defend their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      Dollar profit-taking ahead of the key resistance level of \par \par \uc2  125 and option-linked dollar sales helped the yen recover from \par \par \uc2  124.74 hit early in the day to be around 124.40 in late trade. \par \par \uc2      However, analysts said Japan's grim economic outlook would \par \par \uc2  keep the yen shaky, with consequences for regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      Suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar and the \par \par \uc2  Philippine peso off their lows, while fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  action limited losses in the Korean won and in the Taiwan \par \par \uc2  dollar. \par \par \uc2  Activity was subdued ahead of the U.S. Federal Reserve's \par \par \uc2  policy-setting meeting on June 26-27, when it is widely \par \par \uc2  expected to cut interest rates by at least 25 basis points. \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  The Sing dollar clambered off its intraday lows of 1.8225 \par \par \uc2  on the back of speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \par \par \uc2  Singapore (MAS) was in the market to shore up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they suspected MAS - the city state's de \par \par \uc2  facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - had been in the market since Thursday, \par \par \uc2  chasing the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from 1.8235 and on Friday from \par \par \uc2  1.8225. \par \par \uc2  "We can't get any confirmation yet, but it definitely \par \par \uc2  looked and felt like it. No one else seems to be doing anything \par \par \uc2  except for one European bank and one local bank which the MAS \par \par \uc2  normally trades with," said a senior dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2      Despite the rebound, the Sing dollar remains confined in \par \par \uc2  the U.S. dollar's uptrend channel which dates back to May 24. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     PHILIPPINE PESO\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The peso also closed off its intraday lows of 52.42 on the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par back of rumours that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was in the market to sell\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around $30 million.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But cental bank governor Rafael Buenaventura denied having\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to shore up the peso.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "We could \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if necessary, although we have not\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par found it necessary yet," he said, but added that the level of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the peso was causing some concern.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     He also said that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would not lower or raise\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par overnight interest rates in the near term.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     KOREAN WON\tab    -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won edged towards the stronger end of Friday's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1,308-1,302.4 range due to the yen's rebound, hopes for foreign\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par investment flows and fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said exporters and some interbank\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par players were seen selling dollars around 1,308 on fear a test\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of 1,310 may invite \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     However, dollar demand was intact on equity-related\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par outflows and speculation that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might soon cut\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par its key interest rates after it downgraded the growth outlook\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for the year. The next BOK policy meeting is due on July 5.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par THAI BAHT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The baht was strait-jacketed as players sat out ahead of a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par meeting between commercial banks and the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is expected to seek views from commercial\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par banks on how to streamline reporting rules for non-residents\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trading the baht.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Baht funding costs eased slightly as players took advantage\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of the recent rise, but they generally remained high. The\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par one-month forward rate was quoted at 14/19 satang per dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par offshore and 2.5/6.5 onshore.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par INDONESIAN RUPIAH\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah was locked in a 11,350-11,360 range, in a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par paper-thin market. Dealers in Jakarta said trading volumes were\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par well below $100 million, against usual volumes of $150-250.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The market warily watched the murky political scene as\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par President Abdurrahman Wahid again warned he may call early\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par elections if the parliament moves towards impeaching him.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TAIWAN DOLLAR\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Taiwan dollar closed at 34.434, near key support at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 34.50. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was wedged between support from the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and U.S. dollar demand mainly from foreign equity\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par investors.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Bearish economic data and uncertainty surrounding the yen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par also encouraged players to hold on to their U.S. dollar longs.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Taiwan May industrial output declined 8.2 percent on year\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par while export orders dropped 13.96 percent from same period year\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ago. Dealers said figures came in slightly better than market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par consensus, but were still discouraging.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A senior official at Ministry of Economic Affairs said\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Taiwan's export orders were expected to show year-on-year\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par declines through the rest of 2001.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0835 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     124.39\tab  124.02\tab    -0.30\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.8205\tab  1.8216\tab    +0.06\par  Taiwan dlr    34.434\tab  34.456\tab    +0.06\par  Korean won   1301.00\tab 1303.00\tab    +0.15\par  Baht\tab      45.23\tab   45.21\tab    -0.04\par  Peso\tab      52.16\tab   52.19\tab    +0.06\par  Rupiah\tab 11343.00     11335.00\tab    -0.07\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7995\tab    +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     124.39\tab  114.45\tab    -7.99\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.8205\tab  1.7365\tab    -4.61\par  Taiwan dlr    34.434\tab  32.900\tab    -4.45\par  Korean won   1301.00\tab 1277.00\tab    -1.84\par  Baht\tab      45.23\tab   43.70\tab    -3.38\par  Peso\tab      52.16\tab   50.75\tab    -2.70\par  Rupiah\tab 11343.00\tab 9470.00\tab   -16.51\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7995\tab  3.7995\tab    +0.00.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6m0115t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
