\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Pressured by yen, wary on outlook. \b0\par\par\uc2 1,152 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2001\par 04:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, June 21 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were easier \par \par \uc2  in early trade on Thursday, taking their cues from the yen's \par \par \uc2   overnight decline to five-week lows against the U.S. \par \par \uc2  dollar. \par \par \uc2      The yen dipped to just a shade off the 124 mark, its lowest \par \par \uc2  level since May 16, in New York trade after White House \par \par \uc2  economic adviser Lawrence Lindsey was reported as saying \par \par \uc2  further declines in the yen could be expected due to Japan's \par \par \uc2  structural reforms. \par \par \uc2      The more tech-sensitive North Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  may find \par \par \uc2  some solace in the Nasdaq's near two percent rise in an \par \par \uc2  otherwise grim economic scenario at home and abroad. \par \par \uc2      No fresh clues on the state of the sagging U.S. economy \par \par \uc2  came out of the Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan's \par \par \uc2  testimony to the Senate Banking Committee on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2      However, his comment that inflation was not an immediate \par \par \uc2  worry raised hopes of an interest rate cut when the FOMC meets \par \par \uc2  next week. \par \par \uc2      A majority of Wall Street analysts, 17 out of 25, still \par \par \uc2  believe the cut may not be more than a quarter of a percentage \par \par \uc2  point. \par \par \uc2      In the region's Southeast, players will continue to look \par \par \uc2  warily at the hostage saga in the Philippines, talk of higher \par \par \uc2  interest rates in Thailand, and the violence-prone politics of \par \par \uc2  Indonesia. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     KOREAN WON\tab    -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won edged lower in line with the softer yen, but the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par downside was seen limited on hopes of more investment-related\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par inflows and a firmer tone at the local stock market tracking\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the Nasdaq's gains.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     A senior Korean official said on Wednesday the country\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par expects inflows of up to $8 billion in foreign direct\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par investment in the second half of the year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But added settlement of stocks sold by foreign investors in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recent sessions would continue to pressure the won. Foreign\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par funds sold a net 127 billion won worth of local stocks on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said dollar demand was likely to stay intact at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around 1,290-95, with near-term trading expected within a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1,290-1,320 range.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Sing dollar slid to fresh six-week lows of around\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1.8225 on the back of a softer yen, having spiralled all the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par way from highs around 1.8150 on Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said fears of possible \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  grew as the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par latest drop put the Sing dollar just half a cent away from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around 1.8270, the level the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par was believed to have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at in early May.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Charts showed the dollar was overbought, with a 14-day\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par relative strength index reading at 74. This indicates some\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par scope for correction.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But others noted the Sing dollar's weakness was largely due\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to the yen and in line with other regionals, thus reducing\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  risks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     THAI BAHT\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The baht hovered around 45.30 as the yen slid further,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par still pretty much confined in dollar/baht's uptrend channel\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par which started on June 6.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But its downside was limited by wariness over higher\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par interest rates or further tightening of disclosure rules which\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par would push baht funding costs up.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The one-month forward rate rose to 18/25 satang per dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and the 12-month rate was quoted at 130/180 satang as market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par participants covered positions ahead of mid-year book closings.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had earlier this month raised its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par benchmark 14-day repo rate to 2.5 from 1.5 percent, hoping the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par move would deter outflows by slowing down foreign debt\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par repayment and persuading banks to reduce their foreign asset\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par holdings.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Recently, there were rumours that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  might\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par raise the rate again. Although the Bank of Thailand has denied\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par this, the market was not quite convinced.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     PHILIPPINE PESO\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The peso was on the defensive at 52.15 having recovered to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 51.85 on Wednesday after it touched near a five month low of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 52.33. Profit-taking from both local and foreign banks of long\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar positions in an overbought market had sent it higher.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par      Fears of possible \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has kept it stumbling\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par further beyond 52.20 for now.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Talk circulated in the market on Wednesday a U.S. bank sold\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around $20 million from 52.30 on behalf of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par but it was denied by governor Rafael Buenaventura.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Philippine military said late on Wednesday it had\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par pinned down Muslim guerrillas holding Filipino and U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par hostages in the south and it should not take long for the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par captives to to be rescued.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But this proved cold comfort to dealers as the military has\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said in the past it was close to ending the saga and failed.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah is clouded by political uncertainty, although\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par positive developments on the IMF front should help support it.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The IMF said on Wednesday it was optimistic Indonesia's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par willingness to revise controversial bank law amendments would\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par end a six-month deadlock on a vital $5 billion loan programme.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The international institution froze its aid programme to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesia in December over a raft of missed economic targets\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and foot dragging on reforms.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     In the money market, Bank Indonesia's benchmark one-month\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par SBI certificates fetched a higher rate of 16.55 percent at an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par auction on Wednesday against 16.48 percent last week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SBIs are issued by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as a tool of draining\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par liquidity from the market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     TAIWAN DOLLAR\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Taiwan dollar held its late Wednesday levels around\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 34.40 with players cautious after yesterday's aggressive\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on both sides of the market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers in Singapore said with the yen testing the 124\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par level players may hold on to their U.S. dollar longs on hopes\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may loosen its grip on the downside of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par local dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Though the Nasdaq's rise will help sentiment,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par equity-related outflows will continue to weigh on the local\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar. Foreign investors' local stocks sales in the past five\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sessions were estimated at a net T$1.44 billion.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0136 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     123.85\tab  122.88\tab    -0.78\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.8207\tab  1.8162\tab    -0.25\par  Taiwan dlr    34.466\tab  34.400\tab    -0.19\par  Korean won   1303.00\tab 1295.00\tab    -0.61\par  Baht\tab      45.27\tab   45.19\tab    -0.18\par  Peso\tab      52.05\tab   52.00\tab    -0.10\par  Rupiah\tab 11290.00     11275.00\tab    -0.13\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7998\tab  3.7995\tab    -0.01\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     123.85\tab  114.45\tab    -7.59\par  Sing dlr\tab 1.8207\tab  1.7365\tab    -4.62\par  Taiwan dlr    34.466\tab  32.900\tab    -4.54\par  Korean won   1303.00\tab 1277.00\tab    -2.00\par  Baht\tab      45.27\tab   43.70\tab    -3.47\par  Peso\tab      52.05\tab   50.75\tab    -2.50\par  Rupiah\tab 11290.00\tab 9470.00\tab   -16.12\par  Ringgit\tab  3.7998\tab  3.7995\tab    -0.01.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6l018zf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
