gramme on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  - State banks spotted selling dollars in small amounts unlike when acting on behalf of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  - Golkar, second-largest party in parliaments says will support Vice-President Megawati Sukarnoputri if she takes over from embattled President Abdurrahman Wahid. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx4a02dh2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
